<title>HUNGARY: Hungary May CPI up 1.3 pct m/m, 17.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary May CPI up 1.3 pct m/m, 17.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's consumer price index (CPI) rose 1.3 percent in May from the previous month and was up 17.7 from May 1996, the Central Statistical Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In April the CPI was 1.4 percent up month-on-month and rose 18.6 percent year-on-year.</p>
</text>
